                "description": "The Classic Brass Egg Knob with Rectangular Rosette is beautiful, traditional knobset that is suitable for interior doors needing dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The pairing of the egg shaped knob with the Rectangular rosette has long been a favorite for its old world elegance. The Egg Knobset with Rectangular Rose will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
